{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.92, "text": "they have a money guy, a money guy is so common. Everybody talks about, oh, I have this money guy."}, {"start": 6.66, "end": 12.36, "text": "Your money guy is probably a whole life insurance salesman charging you 1.25% AUM. Let me explain"}, {"start": 12.36, "end": 19.96, "text": "what that means. So many people in America do not want to learn the basics of money, and so they"}, {"start": 19.96, "end": 25.1, "text": "hire a financial advisor. Now, I don't have anything against financial advisors in general,"}, {"start": 25.1, "end": 30.32, "text": "but a money guy that they're typically referring to is someone who charges them a percentage of"}, {"start": 30.32, "end": 36.56, "text": "their assets. So if I have a $100,000 portfolio, they'll charge, or let's say a million dollar"}, {"start": 36.56, "end": 42.38, "text": "portfolio, I might be paying 1%. Now, 1% doesn't sound like a lot, but if you actually run the math,"}, {"start": 42.62, "end": 52.54, "text": "you will pay about 28% of your lifetime investment returns in fees. That's not $10 or $100. That's"}, {"start": 52.54, "end": 57.5, "text": "tens of thousands or sometimes hundreds of thousands of dollars. So it's a red flag if someone has"}, {"start": 57.5, "end": 60.78, "text": "an advisor that they're paying a percentage based fee."}], "words": [{"w": "they", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.24}, {"w": "have", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.46}, {"w": "a", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.68}, {"w": "money", "start": 0.68, "end": 0.98}, {"w": "guy,", "start": 0.98, "end": 1.42}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.54, "end": 2.6}, {"w": "money", "start": 2.6, "end": 2.8}, {"w": "guy", "start": 2.8, "end": 3.12}, {"w": "is", "start": 3.12, "end": 3.4}, {"w": "so", "start": 3.4, "end": 3.68}, {"w": "common.", "start": 3.68, "end": 4.04}, {"w": "Everybody", "start": 4.2, "end": 4.34}, {"w": "talks", "start": 4.34, "end": 4.88}, {"w": "about,", "start": 4.88, "end": 5.06}, {"w": "oh,", "start": 5.06